% holding-blocked: A Grade 4 teacher must trial the syn-co-pa at the start tempo, the change from major to minor at bar 5 and the lyric fit; a second score reader must check the accidentals and chord symbols; a Cuban son educator must review the listening comparison. The title was changed from "Son Lantern" because the piece is not son and the old title named the genre; the lead should confirm the new title.
